            <fw rend="left" xml:id="j001"><add hand="#h03"><metamark target="#j001" function="unknown">&#10003;</metamark></add>64</fw> <fw rend="center">GOOD-BYE MY FANCY.</fw>
            
            <div><p><anchor xml:id="j002"/><add hand="#h03"><metamark target="#j002" function="unknown">&#10003;</metamark></add>but brain normal, and retain my heart's and soul's unmitigated faith not only in their own original literary plans, but in the essential bulk of American humanity east and west, north and south, city and country, through thick and thin, to the last. Nor must I forget, in conclusion, a special, prayerful, thankful God's blessing to my dear firm friends and personal helpers, men and women, home and foreign, old and young.</p></div>
            
            <div>
                <note type="authorial"><hi rend="italics">From the Camden Post, April 19, '91</hi><add hand="#h01">&#8248;</add><add hand="#h01" place="right" rend="marked">.</add></note>
                <head type="main">OUT IN THE OPEN AGAIN.</head>
                
                <p>W<hi rend="smallcaps">ALT</hi> W<hi rend="smallcaps">HITMAN</hi> got out in the mid<add hand="#h01" xml:id="a001">&#8248;</add><add hand="#h01" place="left">=<metamark target="#a001" function="emphasize">/</metamark></add> April sun and warmth of yesterday, propelled in his wheel chair, the first time after four months of imprisonment in his sick room. He had has the worst winter yet, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="2" hand="#h03" xml:id="d001">suffering</del><add place="left" seq="1" hand="#h01">mainly</add><add place="left" hand="#h03" seq="3"><metamark target="#d001" function="delete">&#977;</metamark></add></subst> from grippe and gastric troubles, and threaten<subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1" xml:id="d002">e</del><add place="left" seq="2">,<metamark target="#d002" function="emphasize">&#711;</metamark></add></subst>d blindness; but keeps good spirits, and has a new little forthcoming book in the printer's hands.</p>
            </div>
               
            
           
                         
